let the measure Romeo be 42.
let measure Juliet be 100.

[note: This is an inline comment]

Romeo verily became Romeo combined with Juliet.
Romeo became Romeo parted with Juliet.

[GLOSS: This is a case-insensitive
block comment spanning
multiple lines
END GLOSS]

alas, Romeo matches 42,
    speak the tale "Success!".
    exeunt.

perchance Romeo greater than 50,
    hearken measure Input.

whilst Romeo less than 100,
    repeat until Romeo at least 90.

let truth Flag be aye.
let truth Test be naught.

Romeo became Romeo magnified with 2.
Romeo became Romeo without 10.
Romeo became Romeo remnant with 3.

alas, Romeo belies Juliet,
    speak "Different!".

perchance Romeo at most 200 and Flag matches aye or Test,
    speak "Complex logic".

let legion Numbers hold 5.
let tale Message be "Hello world".
let letter Initial be 'R'.
let fraction Pi be 3 point 14.
speak member 1 of Numbers.


[note: Test noise words]
hark indeed the tale verily speaks with clarity.

